Changes made in F-Builder (2026-11-11 onwards):
- renamed the product, crates, binaries, data folders, environment variables and identifiers
  from Craft Anything to F-Builder (bundle id io.github.thanhlnt3.f-builder);
- removed the ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos (docs/brand/) and the raven app icon
  (assets/app-icon/), which are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team and not open source, and
  replaced the icon with F-Builder's own (assets/app-icon/, MIT OR Apache-2.0);
- changed the interface colours to F-Eco's;
- removed the translated READMEs, the upstream CI workflows and the Linux/FreeBSD packaging;
- further changes are recorded in the F-EcoSystem-Software git history (clients/f-builder/).

